<title>USA: TABLE-Laser Vision Q4 April 30 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Laser Vision Q4 April 30 loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve Month Period	 Three Month Period</p>
<p>		   Ended April 30		Ended April 30</p>
<p>			1997	  1996	   1997	   1996</p>
<p>Total Revenues:</p>
<p>	     $ 8,238,000   $3,918,000   $2,799,000   $1,334,000</p>
<p>Net (Loss):</p>
<p>	   ( 12,069,000) ( 8,803,000) ( 5,308,000) ( 4,679,000)</p>
<p>Net (Loss) Per</p>
<p>  Share:	( 1.45)*     ( 1.75)*	( 0.60)     ( 0.81)*</p>
<p>Weighted Avg. Number</p>
<p>of Common Shares</p>
<p>Outstanding:</p>
<p>		 8,421,000    5,278,000    8,816,000    6,329,000</p>
<p>*Includes accrued dividends on convertible preferred stock</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q4 loss includes a $2.8 million non-cash, fixed-asset impairment and $300,000 of non-recurring expenses amounting to $0.35 a share.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 net loss includes $3 million in expenses which is equal to about $0.48 a share in Q4 and $0.58 a share for the 12 months period.</p>
<p>The company's full name is Laser Vision Centers Inc.</p>
<p>		  ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
